{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "agno-rag-system-collection",
		"name": "Agno RAG System API",
		"description": "基于 Agno 框架的 RAG 系统 API 接口集合\n\n## 使用说明\n\n1. 导入此集合到 Postman\n2. 设置环境变量 `base_url` 为你的服务器地址（默认：http://127.0.0.1:8000）\n3. 开始测试接口\n\n## 接口分组\n\n- **健康检查**：系统健康状态检查\n- **知识库管理**：文档的上传、查询、删除等操作\n- **RAG 查询**：智能问答接口（支持会话和用户记忆）\n- **系统信息**：系统统计和配置信息\n- **会话管理**：会话历史查询\n- **记忆管理**：用户记忆功能状态和清理\n- **AgentOS**：基于 Agno AgentOS 的独立服务（挂载在 /agentos 路径）",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "健康检查",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "根路径健康检查",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								""
							]
						},
						"description": "根端点健康检查，返回系统状态、环境和版本信息"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "健康检查端点",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"health"
							]
						},
						"description": "健康检查端点，返回系统状态、环境和版本信息"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "系统健康状态检查接口"
		},
		{
			"name": "知识库管理",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "上传文档",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "file",
									"type": "file",
									"src": [],
									"description": "Markdown 格式文档文件"
								},
								{
									"key": "chunk_method",
									"value": "markdown",
									"type": "text",
									"description": "文档切分方法：recursive、markdown、semantic（默认：markdown）"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/documents/upload",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"documents",
								"upload"
							]
						},
						"description": "上传 Markdown 文档到知识库，系统会自动切分并生成向量嵌入"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "添加文档（文件路径）",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"file_path\": \"/path/to/document.md\",\n    \"chunk_method\": \"markdown\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/documents/add",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"documents",
								"add"
							]
						},
						"description": "通过文件路径添加文档到知识库（适用于服务器本地文件）"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "列出所有文档",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/documents",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"documents"
							]
						},
						"description": "获取知识库中所有文档的列表"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "获取文档详情",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"documents",
								"{{document_id}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "根据文档 ID 获取文档的详细信息"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "删除文档",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/documents/{{document_id}}",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"documents",
								"{{document_id}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "从知识库中删除指定文档及其所有切片"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "知识库文档管理接口，包括上传、查询、删除等操作"
		},
		{
			"name": "RAG 查询",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "查询问答",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"question\": \"文档中提到了什么内容？\",\n    \"top_k\": 5,\n    \"similarity_threshold\": 0.7,\n    \"session_id\": \"optional-session-id\",\n    \"user_id\": \"optional-user-id\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/query",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"query"
							]
						},
						"description": "向 RAG 系统提问，系统会从知识库中检索相关信息并生成答案\n\n**参数说明：**\n- `question`: 用户问题（必填）\n- `top_k`: 检索的文档片段数量（可选，默认使用配置值）\n- `similarity_threshold`: 相似度阈值（可选，默认使用配置值）\n- `session_id`: 会话 ID（可选，用于会话持久化）\n- `user_id`: 用户 ID（可选，用于记忆功能，如果未提供则使用 session_id 或默认值）"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "查询问答（带会话和用户）",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"question\": \"继续上面的问题\",\n    \"top_k\": 5,\n    \"similarity_threshold\": 0.7,\n    \"session_id\": \"{{session_id}}\",\n    \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/query",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"query"
							]
						},
						"description": "带会话 ID 和用户 ID 的查询，可以保持对话上下文和用户记忆"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "RAG 智能问答接口，支持会话持久化和用户记忆功能"
		},
		{
			"name": "系统信息",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "获取切分方法列表",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/chunkers",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"chunkers"
							]
						},
						"description": "获取系统支持的所有文档切分方法"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "获取系统统计",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/stats",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"stats"
							]
						},
						"description": "获取系统统计信息，包括向量数据库统计、文档数量、环境信息、AgentDB 状态等"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "系统信息和配置查询接口"
		},
		{
			"name": "会话管理",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "获取会话历史",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/sessions/{{session_id}}/history",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"sessions",
								"{{session_id}}",
								"history"
							]
						},
						"description": "获取指定会话的历史记录，需要先启用 agent_db.enabled 配置"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "会话历史管理接口"
		},
		{
			"name": "记忆管理",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "获取记忆功能状态",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/memory/status",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"memory",
								"status"
							]
						},
						"description": "获取记忆功能的启用状态和配置信息，包括数据库连接状态、表创建状态等"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "清理用户记忆",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/memory/{{user_id}}/prune?keep_count=10",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"v1",
								"memory",
								"{{user_id}}",
								"prune"
							],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "keep_count",
									"value": "10",
									"description": "保留的记忆数量（可选，默认 10）"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "清理指定用户的记忆，保留最近的 N 条记忆。用于管理用户记忆数据，避免数据过多。\n\n**参数说明：**\n- `user_id`: 用户 ID（路径参数）\n- `keep_count`: 保留的记忆数量（查询参数，可选，默认 10）"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "用户记忆功能管理接口，包括状态查询和记忆清理"
		},
		{
			"name": "AgentOS",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "AgentOS 服务说明",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/agentos",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"agentos"
							]
						},
						"description": "AgentOS 是基于 Agno AgentOS 的独立服务，挂载在 /agentos 路径下。\n\nAgentOS 提供了完整的 Agent 管理功能，包括：\n- Agent 的创建和管理\n- 会话和记忆管理\n- 知识库集成（Milvus）\n- MySQL 数据库持久化\n\n**注意**：AgentOS 服务需要正确配置 MySQL 和 Milvus 才能正常工作。如果初始化失败，主应用仍会继续运行，但 AgentOS 路由将不可用。\n\n访问 AgentOS 的 API 文档：\n- Swagger UI: {{base_url}}/agentos/docs\n- ReDoc: {{base_url}}/agentos/redoc"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "AgentOS 服务接口说明（基于 Agno AgentOS 框架）"
		}
	],
